    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότος, πίνω</span>)
